<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The law of life in me is spreading.</l><l>Thus, my mind, emotion, will</l><l>He’s now conforming.</l><l>So, I open to His working within me</l><l>Til my whole being</l><l>Bears the image</l><l>Of the Son of God.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The life of God in me is reigning,</l><l>And my natural life in Adam</l><l>Is always dying;</l><l>Now Christ person is maturing within us,</l><l>As Christ’s own Body,</l><l>A duplication</l><l>Of the Son of God.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
